carbonenginejs/tools-blender
===========================

A pure-Python Blender importer and reader for RAD Game Tools' Granny 3D (.gr2)
file format, plus an EVE resource-index browser. Contains no RAD/Granny code
and does not link granny2.dll. Section decompression is reimplemented from
clean-room / open reverse-engineering efforts, listed below.

CarbonEngineJS-facing code is copyright cppctamber / CarbonEngineJS
contributors. CarbonEngine source material, formats, class names, and schema
semantics remain copyright their original CarbonEngine authors.
Fenris Creations (CCP Games) source material, tools, assets, shader behavior,
and EVE-related data remain copyright their original holders.

Current repository license: MIT. See LICENSE.

The former EUPL-derived BitKnit2 translation was replaced on 2026-07-24 by a
Python port of CarbonEngineJS's MIT clean-room decoder. No EUPL-derived code
remains in the current BitKnit2 implementation.

